{"4459510": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Nightwal Legacy", "steam_appid": 4459510, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Dark Presence has awakened in the Nightwal Manor. In this first-person supernatural thriller, Kendrick returns home despite warnings from his brother to stay away. After realizing that the manor has descended into darkness, he must wield a mysterious power to uncover the truth and confront the ancient entity consuming his brother. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXORCISE THE DARKNESS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Kendrick Nightwal, you are armed with a revolver, a mysterious power, and other scarce supplies while Dark Manifestations stalk the mansion. When they find you, be ready. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4459510/extras/ffa2843c334d9009c7a2f66ca6f31984.poster.avif?t=1781023779\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4459510/extras/ffa2843c334d9009c7a2f66ca6f31984.webm?t=1781023779\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4459510/extras/ffa2843c334d9009c7a2f66ca6f31984.mp4?t=1781023779\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your inventory and resources carefully, as supplies in the mansion are limited.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UNCOVER A CENTURY OF BURIED SECRETS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your brother is running out of time. The answers are somewhere in this mansion. You must unravel the mystery and figure out how to save him before its too late.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4459510/extras/9c99a483eff3326afe6be0e1b6b0d0d2.poster.avif?t=1781023779\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4459510/extras/9c99a483eff3326afe6be0e1b6b0d0d2.webm?t=1781023779\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4459510/extras/9c99a483eff3326afe6be0e1b6b0d0d2.mp4?t=1781023779\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE THE NIGHTWAL MANOR</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every room holds something. Not all of it wants to be found. Explore your surroundings and learn the truth about a house that stopped being a home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4459510/extras/a28db5c4a675d7ba813061048de7c4d0.poster.avif?t=1781023779\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4459510/extras/a28db5c4a675d7ba813061048de7c4d0.webm?t=1781023779\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4459510/extras/a28db5c4a675d7ba813061048de7c4d0.mp4?t=1781023779\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Dark Presence has awakened in the Nightwal Manor. In this first-person supernatural thriller, Kendrick returns home despite warnings from his brother to stay away. After realizing that the manor has descended into darkness, he must wield a mysterious power to uncover the truth and confront the ancient entity consuming his brother. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXORCISE THE DARKNESS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Kendrick Nightwal, you are armed with a revolver, a mysterious power, and other scarce supplies while Dark Manifestations stalk the mansion. When they find you, be ready. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4459510/extras/ffa2843c334d9009c7a2f66ca6f31984.poster.avif?t=1781023779\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4459510/extras/ffa2843c334d9009c7a2f66ca6f31984.webm?t=1781023779\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4459510/extras/ffa2843c334d9009c7a2f66ca6f31984.mp4?t=1781023779\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your inventory and resources carefully, as supplies in the mansion are limited.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UNCOVER A CENTURY OF BURIED SECRETS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your brother is running out of time. The answers are somewhere in this mansion. You must unravel the mystery and figure out how to save him before its too late.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4459510/extras/9c99a483eff3326afe6be0e1b6b0d0d2.poster.avif?t=1781023779\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4459510/extras/9c99a483eff3326afe6be0e1b6b0d0d2.webm?t=1781023779\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4459510/extras/9c99a483eff3326afe6be0e1b6b0d0d2.mp4?t=1781023779\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE THE NIGHTWAL MANOR</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every room holds something. Not all of it wants to be found. Explore your surroundings and learn the truth about a house that stopped being a home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster